WEBVTT

1
00:01:07.329 --> 00:01:11.230
When your heart's in someone else's hands

2
00:01:12.159 --> 00:01:14.000
Monkey see and monkey do

3
00:01:14.299 --> 00:01:16.980
Their wish is your command

4
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.099
You're not to blame

5
00:01:21.659 --> 00:01:23.430
Everyone's the same

6
00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:33.439
All you do is love and love is all you do

7
00:01:34.739 --> 00:01:38.909
I should know by now the way I fought for you

8
00:01:40.989 --> 00:01:51.420
You're not to blame, everyone's the same, mmm-whoa

9
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.260
I know you think that you're safe

10
00:01:55.299 --> 00:01:56.340
Mister

11
00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.780
Harmless deception

12
00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.260
That keeps love at bay

13
00:02:01.519 --> 00:02:06.840
It's the ones who resist that we most want to kiss

14
00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:09.900
Wouldn't you say?

15
00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.780
Cowboys and angels

16
00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:19.409
They all have the time for you

17
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:24.909
Why should I imagine that I'd be a find for you

18
00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.539
Why should I imagine

19
00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:32.090
That I'd have something to say

20
00:02:39.539 --> 00:02:42.550
But that scar on your face

21
00:02:45.159 --> 00:02:48.870
That beautiful face of yours

22
00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.849
In your heart there's a trace

23
00:02:54.039 --> 00:02:58.210
Of someone before

24
00:03:02.639 --> 00:03:06.169
When your heart's in someone else's plans

25
00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:09.610
Things you say and things you do

26
00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.319
They don't understand

27
00:03:13.719 --> 00:03:15.020
It's such a shame

28
00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:19.030
Always ends the same

29
00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:28.900
You can call it love but I don't think it's true

30
00:03:29.719 --> 00:03:32.039
You should know by now

31
00:03:32.039 --> 00:03:33.900
I'm not the boy for you

32
00:03:33.979 --> 00:03:37.750
You're not to blame

33
00:03:39.379 --> 00:03:42.360
Always ends the same

34
00:03:46.479 --> 00:03:50.340
I know you think that you're safe

35
00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.500
Sister

36
00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:56.419
Harmless affection that keeps things this way

37
00:03:56.639 --> 00:04:01.860
It's the ones who persist for the sake of a kiss

38
00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:05.849
Who will pay

39
00:04:08.479 --> 00:04:11.000
Cowboys and angels

40
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.479
They all take a shine to you

41
00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:20.300
Why should I imagine that I was designed for you

42
00:04:20.839 --> 00:04:23.259
Why should I believe

43
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.689
That you would stay

44
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.720
But that scar on your face

45
00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:44.389
That beautiful face of yours

46
00:04:45.649 --> 00:04:48.629
Don't you think that I'd know

47
00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:53.519
They've hurt you before

48
00:04:56.839 --> 00:05:00.240
Take this man to your bed

49
00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:06.899
Maybe his hands will help you forget

50
00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.000
Please be stronger than your past

51
00:05:14.509 --> 00:05:29.509
The future may still give you a chance

